flowchart LR
    A[Architecture Standard] --> B[CLAUDE.md Instruction]
    B --> C[AI Agent Implementation]

    A --> D[Architecture Test]
    A --> E[Security Gate]
    A --> F[Contract Test]

    C --> D
    C --> E
    C --> F

    D --> G{All Gates Pass?}
    E --> G
    F --> G

    G -- No --> H[Return Evidence to Agent]
    H --> C

    G -- Yes --> I[Reviewer / Evaluator]
    I --> J[Human Approval]
